 more steadily and can no longer grow explosively. Growth is capped per turn, also, in order to grow at maximum speed it needs demand to be met for all products. Note for the 200 Turn Chal","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:43:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039545","verified_at":"2026-10-24T13:51:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5060950-1846651706685655","game_id":"steam-5060950","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #55-64 - Updates and Changes, DEMO is done!","summary":"DEMO is out tonight! Thank you! The Equilibrium Co. demo is now live!. The demo is out, just in time for Steam Next Fest. Everything is unlocked, the only limit is 200 turns. Build your supply chains, run your stores, produce goods, import/export, and see how far your company gets!What's in the demoFull logistics - set truck routes between industries, warehouses, stores, and the global market (import/export) Production chains - build your own industries, see each recipe before you build, and tra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:20:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685655","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5060950-1842212951301203","game_id":"steam-5060950","kind":"announcement","title":"55 Devlogs in 1","summary":"Hey everyone! Welcome to my first devlog that combines 55 devlogs and whole development process into one devlog!! ːsteamhappyːIt's time to take the step back and take a look at the big picture! We will go through all of the system, and current development status and see how far we have come with all the systems and game development. Enjoy! First of all we will go through all the game design and e